<title>USA: Tracor unit awarded Justice Dept contract.</title>
<headline>Tracor unit awarded Justice Dept contract.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vitro Corp, a subsidiary of Tracor Inc, said Wednesday it was awarded a five-year U.S. Department of Justice contract with a potential value of $103 million.</p>
<p>Under the contract, Vitro and eight subcontractors, will provide software engineering and re-engineering tools, process methodologies, and systems and software engineers to improve the Justice Department's information-processing capabilties.</p>
